  "description": "INSTALLATION OF MEZZAINE FLOORS AND ERECTION OF ELECTRICAL PLANT AND MACHINERY TO THE REAR OF THE BUILDING AND EXTENSION TO THE PERMITTED B2/B8 USE TO INCLUDE USE AS A DATA STORAGE FACILITY.",
